                    {
                      "id": "QdktS",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "领导选举：currentTerm / votedFor / log up-to-date"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "YrzkK",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "日志复制：leader 只能通过 apply 当前 term 的日志，间接 apply 之前 term 的日志"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "YmbYB",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "快照：上层 service 和 raft 需要保证安装快照的原子性"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "RBeEw",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "成员变更"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "AbbtA",
                  "type": "mind_child",
                  "data": {
                    "topic": {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "优化"
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    }
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "HXEbc",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "读操作：原始读操作写 log 并广播共识，效率低"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "nPMFT",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "readIndex：① leader 将 commitIndex 记录为 readIndex；② 发起心跳但不带 log（不落盘），以此确认自己仍获多数派同意是 leader；③ 等到 lastApplied 超过 readIndex 即可安全返回"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "nbRiE",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "leader lease：① leader 发送心跳后标记时间戳 start；② 得到多数派支持，lease 有效期 = start + election timeout / clock drift bound；需要各服务器时钟偏移较小"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "HAFfQ",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "follower read：follower 转发 leader 获取 readIndex，等自身 lastApplied 超过 readIndex 即可安全返回"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "GWEAs",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "pre-vote"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "kpkdG",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "no-op log entry"
