                    {
                      "id": "XTJNh",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "场景：全球范围的一致性数据存储服务"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "wahbC",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "架构：跨 datacenter 的 multi-paxos group"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "jHFAm",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "只读事务：无锁，基于 Truetime commit-wait 和 snapshot 实现"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "dZdGW",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "读写事务：上悲观锁，基于 Truetime commit-wait 和 wound-wait 实现；写操作走 2PC，上锁并等待 paxos group quorum ack；wound-wait 避免死锁；或简单对 key 排序加锁；coordinator 与 participant 是同一个时 IPC 更少"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "HdddF",
                  "type": "mind_child",
                  "data": {
                    "topic": {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "Memcache_Facebook"
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    }
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "Dfyrd",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "最终一致性"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "KakCB",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "场景：Facebook 读多写少的用户社交业务，低延迟要求，写后读需一致"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "NFmbe",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "架构：东西海岸 datacenter，单 mysql-cluster + 多 front-end-clusters"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "QATmn",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "读写：读操作直接读本地 memcache，性能极高；写操作只能写主，mysql 落盘，但不需要等待从响应"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "PWBJR",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "分区和复制：上层 front-end-clusters 做复制，使得热 key 可并发访问"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "McEhE",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "缓存一致性：look-aside cache；look-through cache；Mysql 异步日志复制（类似消息队列到 memcache）；lease 租约——delete 热 key 后给第一个请求分配 lease，后续请求等待，拿到 lease 的做 put cache，避免惊群"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "BCWND",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "跨数据中心：写请求只能先打主 datacenter；用标记 Rk 表示写请求在主 datacenter 但还没到从 datacenter；若存在 Rk 则直接读主 datacenter；写延迟——部分操作根据依赖排序等待"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "rTPxz",
                  "type": "mind_child",
                  "data": {
                    "topic": {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "COPS"
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    }
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "FBayn",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "一致性：因果一致性"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "QnDEB",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "场景：类似相册-图片的社区场景，存在一定的并发写和读"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "FpAHG",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "读写：读操作带上 context 读本地 datacenter；写操作带上 context 写本地 datacenter，异步复制"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "xDMhT",
                      "type": "mind_child",
                      "data": {
                        "topic": {
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "实现：维护 context（key-version、dependencies 等）；client library 带上 context，存 key-version 或 dependencies；后续请求指定 version 后，等待直到 key 满足 version 才返回；lamport clock + 节点唯一 id 实现 version number；并发写冲突 latter-write-win"
                            }
                          ],
                          "type": "paragraph"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
